`);`. Change the call to pass `deps: { ...deps, admitWaitSeconds: deps.admitWaitSeconds ?? COMPARE_ADMIT_WAIT_SECONDS }`. Replace line 148 with: `if (!app.ok) { stderr.write(`mc: ${ref}: ${app.error}
`); if (app.refused?.reason === 'cap') { const hint = runningCompares(worktree, tree.dir, deps); if (hint) stderr.write(`mc: ${hint}
